# Written into this directory by `next dev` itself, from
# node_modules/next/dist/server/lib/generate-agent-files.js (Next 16.3.1), and re-added on
# every dev-server start. `CLAUDE.md` here contains only `@AGENTS.md`.
#
# Ignored rather than committed: under Claude Code semantics a directory-scoped CLAUDE.md is
# loaded as project instructions, so a build tool that writes one is injecting instructions
# nobody in this repository reviewed. The root CLAUDE.md is untouched by it and stays tracked.
AGENTS.md
